---
title: 妖狐は人狼に襲撃されても死なない (attack-immune trait)
setup: { werehamster: 1, werewolf: 1, villager: 3 }
rules:
  general.first-victim: none
---
# Day 1 投票で Dave (村) 処刑 (Day 1 終了時点で wolf=1 vs nonWolf=2 → 継続)。
# Night 1 で Carol (狼) が Bob (妖狐) を襲撃 → engine は attack-immune trait を
# 検出して襲撃を無効化、 peace event を emit、 Bob は生存。
# Carol の attackHistory[1] には集約決定された target=Bob が記録される。
# Day 2 で Carol を処刑 → 狼全滅 + 狐生存 → werehamster_won。

++Alice、Bob、Carol、Dave、Eve
!Alice=村人
!Bob=妖狐
!Carol=人狼
!Dave=村人
!Eve=村人
!Carol 1夜 襲撃 Bob

# == engine: Night 0 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Alice→Dave
Bob→Dave
Carol→Dave
Eve→Dave
Dave→Carol

# == engine: Day 1 ==
# vote tally: Dave 4 / Carol 1 → execution=Dave
# == end ==
# == engine: Night 1 ==
# peace (襲撃が attack-immune で無効)
# == end ==

Day 2:

Alice→Carol
Bob→Carol
Eve→Carol
Carol→Bob

# == engine: Day 2 ==
# vote tally: Carol 3 / Bob 1 → execution=Carol
# == end ==
# == engine: Final ==
# result: werehamster_won
# survivors: Alice, Bob, Eve
# == end ==

# @expect-event peace
# @expect-status Bob: alive
# @expect-attack actor:Carol night:1 target:Bob
